# Smart DNS Hosts File Template
# VPS IP: __VPS_IP__
# Generated: __DATE__
#
# This file is auto-generated by setup.sh or maintain.sh regenerate-hosts
# Do NOT edit manually — your changes will be overwritten.
# To regenerate: sudo ./scripts/maintain.sh regenerate-hosts
#
# --- DoH (router) vs download speed ---
# Your router's "DNS over HTTPS" URL only decides WHO answers DNS (e.g. https://YOURDOMAIN/dns-query
# on this VPS, or a third-party like https://xbox-dns.ru/dns-query). Third-party DoH uses THEIR
# host list, not this file. Bytes for downloads do NOT flow through the DoH server — only small
# DNS queries do. For fast installs, Store/delivery/CDN names are intentionally NOT pinned below
# so clients resolve to geo-local Microsoft/CDN IPs on YOUR internet, not hairpinned via the VPS.

