# === CONNECTIVITY & NAT DETECTION ===
# These domains are EXCLUDED (must resolve to real Microsoft IPs)
# Xbox connects directly to Microsoft for NAT testing — Microsoft needs to
# see your REAL public IP, not the VPS IP, for accurate NAT detection.
#
# Excluded domains (resolve via upstream DNS):
#   msftncsi.com, dns/www/ipv6.msftncsi.com       (network connectivity check)
#   msftconnecttest.com, www/ipv4/ipv6             (connection test)
#   xbox.nat.microsoft.com                         (NAT type detection)
#   xbox.ipv4.microsoft.com                        (IPv4 NAT check)
#   xbox.ipv6.microsoft.com                        (IPv6 NAT check)
#   teredo.ipv6.microsoft.com                      (Teredo tunnel server)
#
# === CDN & BULK DELIVERY (do NOT pin — use direct DNS) ===
# Store catalog, delivery, Akamai edges, Azure blobs, and download APIs should resolve to
# real geo-local IPs for speed. Only pin what your ISP actually blocks (core Xbox/auth above).
# Unpinned examples: *.mp.microsoft.com storefront APIs, titlestorage, *.blob.core.windows.net,
# displaycatalog, storeedgefd, collections, purchase, dl.delivery — not listed as __VPS_IP__ below.

# === XBOX SOCIAL / PARTY / MESSAGING ===
__VPS_IP__ social.xboxlive.com
__VPS_IP__ peoplehub.xboxlive.com
